    "independence_basis": "Enumeration of the 10^4 (and 4^6) equally likely noise cells of the declared binary SCMs gives the cross-world counterfactual truth straight from the structural equations; the expanded contingency table is rebuilt from the same cells and the edge g-formula is recomputed from it with numpy and must reproduce the structural truth to 1e-12. Counterfactuals come from evaluating the structural equations under the cross-world assignment on every noise cell, not from any g-formula; the g-formula is then applied to the table as a cross-check, so the truth and the table share only the declared SCM. Imports no Antecedent code; numpy and the comparison helper are tooling.",
